WEBVTT

00:00:09.198 --> 00:00:10.859
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Hey, yeah.

00:00:11.208 --> 00:00:12.073
I’m on my way.

00:00:12.792 --> 00:00:14.667
What’s the best way to get to the bar?

00:00:15.484 --> 00:00:16.166
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> By Tube.

00:00:17.016 --> 00:00:20.276
Get the Piccadilly line westbound to King’s Cross.

00:00:20.443 --> 00:00:21.828
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> OK, and then?

00:00:22.573 --> 00:00:27.307
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Then change to the Victoria line southbound and get off at Warren Street.

00:00:27.474 --> 00:00:28.771
It’s only two stops.

00:00:29.953 --> 00:00:31.135
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Could you say that again?

00:00:32.153 --> 00:00:35.677
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Get the Piccadilly line westbound to King’s Cross.

00:00:36.115 --> 00:00:40.610
Then change to the Victoria line southbound and get off at Warren Street.

00:00:40.776 --> 00:00:42.125
It’s only two stops.

00:00:44.130 --> 00:00:45.015
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Where’s the bar?

00:00:47.313 --> 00:00:49.063
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Turn right out of the station,

00:00:50.276 --> 00:00:53.703
then go straight on about fifty metres and take the second right.

00:00:54.557 --> 00:00:55.531
That’s Grafton Way.

00:00:56.698 --> 00:00:57.974
The place is on the left.

00:00:58.431 --> 00:01:00.021
It’s called The Conversation Bar.

00:01:00.917 --> 00:01:02.597
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Got it, thanks.

00:01:03.932 --> 00:01:04.620
See you soon.

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:05.771
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> And Ben…

00:01:06.417 --> 00:01:06.771
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Yeah…

00:01:07.531 --> 00:01:09.161
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Please don’t be late.